[statement]
A package whose condition is completed while the walk is inside the walk of
its own dependency is placed before that dependency: `x`, a dependency of
`kw`, completes `extra`'s condition, and `extra`'s dependency on `kw`, being
walked, is passed over, as in a cycle.

[repository]
P:kw
V:1
D:x

P:x
V:1

P:extra
V:1
i:x
D:kw

[request]
kw

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install x 1
install extra 1
install kw 1
